      "text": "Goofish (Xianyu) seller kit: **persistent-profile login SOP** (device fingerprint stays fixed so risk-control treats you as a regular; cookies last weeks, face-verify only once), daily keepalive, listing checklist discipline, and listing-copy drafting."
